1
00:00:00,970 --> 00:00:03,301
我们走出美食厨房
And as we make our way out of the gourmet kitchen,

2
00:00:03,301 --> 00:00:06,172
回到客厅温暖的怀抱
we find ourselves way back in the warm embrace of the parlor.

3
00:00:06,262 --> 00:00:07,123
放松 公爵夫人
Easy, dutches.

4
00:00:07,123 --> 00:00:09,023
一间屋子而已 又不是高斯福德庄园
It's just one room, not Gosford Park .

5
00:00:09,033 --> 00:00:10,564
你们从哪儿弄来这么好看的家具
Where'd you get all this sweet furniture?

6
00:00:10,564 --> 00:00:12,895
我们租的 好让家里显得更舒适温馨一点
We rented it to make the house feel more comfortable and inviting.

7
00:00:12,895 --> 00:00:14,675
别坐那儿 天呐
Don't sit there! Oh, my gosh.

8
00:00:14,675 --> 00:00:17,346
我刚花了20分钟才把这褶皱弄好
It took me 20 minutes to get these chops just right.

9
00:00:17,666 --> 00:00:18,747
好了 现在看着直吗
There. Does that look straight?

10
00:00:18,747 --> 00:00:20,417
怎么看都不"直"
Nothing about that looks straight.

11
00:00:21,027 --> 00:00:22,848
我好喜欢这房子 太美了
I love the house. It's beautiful.

12
00:00:22,848 --> 00:00:24,008
送你们一棵小树
Here is a tree.

13
00:00:24,008 --> 00:00:24,999
这是马拉巴栗
It's a pachira,

14
00:00:24,999 --> 00:00:27,440
在台湾人心中象征着财运
a taiwanese symbol of good financial fortune.

15
00:00:27,630 --> 00:00:28,770
所以也被称作发财树
So it's also known as a money tree.

16
00:00:28,770 --> 00:00:30,000
我也是棵"摇钱树"
That makes two of us.

17
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:32,361
我提议大家共同举杯
Well, I would like to propose a toast.

18
00:00:34,292 --> 00:00:35,332
我空了
Missed me.

19
00:00:35,382 --> 00:00:37,813
感谢克莱尔和卡梅隆的辛勤付出
To the hard work of Claire and Cameron--

20
00:00:37,813 --> 00:00:39,864
我也喜欢叫他们"克莱梅隆"
Or as I like to call them, "Clameron",

21
00:00:39,864 --> 00:00:41,865
未来买家看到这房子时
which is what potential home buyers will be doing

22
00:00:41,865 --> 00:00:43,385
就会这样
when they see this place.

23
00:00:43,395 --> 00:00:44,596
"客来猛要"
Clamoring.

24
00:00:46,356 --> 00:00:48,977
-房客来了猛要 -菲尔 别解释了
- Clamoring t-to buy it f-- - Phil, don't go back for it.

25
00:00:49,387 --> 00:00:52,388
因为这座房子一定会大卖的
Because this house is going to sell.

26
00:00:52,538 --> 00:00:54,239
镇上最厉害的房产经纪人是谁
Who's the best realtor in town?

27
00:00:54,239 --> 00:00:55,409
-格尔·索普 -没错
- Gil Thorpe. - That's right,

28
00:00:55,409 --> 00:00:57,400
-明天下午他会带客户过来 -没错
- And he has buyers coming over tomorrow. - That's right.

29
00:00:57,400 --> 00:00:58,840
太好了
All right.

30
00:00:58,840 --> 00:01:01,101
敬克莱尔和小卡
To Claire and Cam.

31
00:01:01,101 --> 00:01:03,172
我姐姐和我爱人
My sister. My partner.

32
00:01:03,312 --> 00:01:05,263
我姐姐 我爱人 我姐姐 我爱人
My sister! My partner! My sister! My partner!

33
00:01:05,263 --> 00:01:07,293
-《唐人街》中的笑话 -还是空的
- "Chinatown." hilarious. - Still empty.

34
00:01:07,293 --> 00:01:08,314
你知道我得坐你的车吧
Okay, you know you're my ride.

35
00:01:08,314 --> 00:01:10,024
-敬克莱梅隆 -干杯 干杯
- To Clameron! - Hear, hear.

36
00:01:10,024 --> 00:01:11,095
请发言
Speech!

37
00:01:11,095 --> 00:01:13,265
天呐 我没有准备
Oh! Well, gosh, I wasn't prepared for this.

38
00:01:13,265 --> 00:01:14,306
我 我们衷心感谢哪些
I...I think we should just really thank the people--

39
00:01:14,306 --> 00:01:16,587
-感谢这次的优秀装修团队 -好吧
- Here's to the best construction crew in the business. - Okay. Okay.

40
00:01:16,587 --> 00:01:18,847
汉克 路易斯以及帕克
Hank. Luis. Paco!

41
00:01:19,298 --> 00:01:20,928
你要是也在就好了 伙计
Wish you could be here right now, buddy.

42
00:01:20,928 --> 00:01:21,658
怎么 他死了吗
What? Did he die?

43
00:01:21,668 --> 00:01:22,909
没有 他在屋顶上修理
No, he's on the roof fixing the shingle

44
00:01:22,909 --> 00:01:24,489
本来第一次就该弄好的木瓦
that he should've gotten right the first time.

45
00:01:24,489 --> 00:01:25,300
我觉得最重要的人
I guess the most important people-

46
00:01:25,300 --> 00:01:26,720
-然后敬我的爱人 -对
- And then to my partner. - Yes.

47
00:01:26,720 --> 00:01:28,361
我的人生伴侣
My lifelong companion.

48
00:01:28,671 --> 00:01:29,701
我的爱
My lovah.

49
00:01:29,981 --> 00:01:31,012
好了 小卡
Okay, Cam.

50
00:01:31,022 --> 00:01:33,863
他一直都反对这项工程
Who had his doubts about this project the whole time,

51
00:01:33,863 --> 00:01:36,463
但在我最低谷的时候 也没对我说
And never, even in my darkest moment,

52
00:01:36,463 --> 00:01:37,724
"我早就告诉过你了吧"
said "I told you so."

53
00:01:37,734 --> 00:01:39,304
那很好 不然他就错了
Which is good because he would've been wrong.

54
00:01:39,465 --> 00:01:40,835
真有爱
Very gracious.

55
00:01:40,835 --> 00:01:43,196
我相信这房子一定一下子就能卖掉
And I'm sure that the house is gonna sell in no time.

56
00:01:44,186 --> 00:01:46,017
太棒了 干杯 干杯
Great. Hear, hear!

57
00:01:46,017 --> 00:01:48,198
我有个朋友也想买房子
Hey, I've got a friend who wants to buy a house.

58
00:01:48,198 --> 00:01:50,098
也许我放学后能带他过来
Maybe I can show it to him after school.

59
00:01:50,108 --> 00:01:52,209
如果他买了 得给我些佣金
Then if he buys it, I'd get the commission.

60
00:01:52,209 --> 00:01:52,979
怎么样
What would that be?

61
00:01:52,979 --> 00:01:54,200
真可爱
Adorable.

62
00:01:54,210 --> 00:01:56,250
我说正经的 我才不可爱呢
I'm serious. And I'm not adorable.

63
00:01:56,250 --> 00:01:57,671
我要留小胡子
I'm getting a mustache.

64
00:02:00,162 --> 00:02:01,982
我现在学会字母表了[儿歌]
I know my a-b-c's.

65
00:02:01,982 --> 00:02:04,183
我猜你一会儿没成为焦点就难受是吧
I guess things weren't about you for a second.

66
00:02:04,183 --> 00:02:06,084
好了 别闹了
Okay, wrapping this up.

67
00:02:06,084 --> 00:02:08,144
敬房地产史上最快售出的房子
To the fastest sale in real estate history.

68
00:02:08,144 --> 00:02:09,825
没错 太棒了
Yes! Bravo!

69
00:02:09,825 --> 00:02:12,066
说真的 跟空杯子碰杯会倒霉的
Seriously, it's bad luck to toast with an empty glass.

70
00:02:25,520 --> 00:02:26,871
邓菲 跟你说实话吧
Dunphy, I'm not gonna lie to you.

71
00:02:27,131 --> 00:02:29,652
你们这房子弄得很不错 我的客户想入手
You guys did a nice job on the house. My buyer wants in.

72
00:02:29,652 --> 00:02:32,363
太好了 真是个好消息
Fantastic! That is great news!

73
00:02:32,563 --> 00:02:33,913
我们刚开工的时候
You know, when we first got into this--

74
00:02:34,133 --> 00:02:35,404
别扯闲篇了
the small talk's over.

75
00:02:35,434 --> 00:02:36,704
这是我们的开价
Here's what we're prepared to offer.

76
00:02:36,704 --> 00:02:37,745
你开玩笑呢吧
You're joking, right?

77
00:02:37,745 --> 00:02:39,175
做房产我从不开玩笑
I don't joke about real estate.

78
00:02:39,785 --> 00:02:42,556
我只拿高尔夫和墨西哥人开玩笑
I joke about golf and Mexicans.

79
00:02:42,736 --> 00:02:44,267
不过没关系 我老婆就是墨西哥人
It's okay, though. I'm married to one.

80
00:02:44,267 --> 00:02:45,377
我们不可能接受的
W-we're not gonna take this.

81
00:02:45,377 --> 00:02:46,358
那房子才第一天上市
It's the first day on the market.

82
00:02:46,358 --> 00:02:48,398
-我们甚至连保本都难 -接受吧
- We'd barely break even. - Take it.

83
00:02:49,049 --> 00:02:49,739
不行
No.

84
00:02:49,739 --> 00:02:51,619
-市场现在一落千丈 -没有
- The market's crashing! - Nuh-unh.

85
00:02:51,619 --> 00:02:52,660
你已经泥足深陷了
You're in over your head.

86
00:02:52,660 --> 00:02:53,750
你才泥足深陷呢
Maybe you're in over your head.

87
00:02:53,750 --> 00:02:54,731
邓菲 听我说
Dunphy, listen to me.

88
00:02:55,191 --> 00:02:57,522
过了这村 你会后悔的
If you pass up on this, you're gonna regret it.

89
00:02:57,522 --> 00:03:00,733
我完全不懂"后悔"二字的意思
I don't know the meaning of the word "Regret."

90
00:03:00,733 --> 00:03:03,183
来了 法式吐司配双层培根
Here we go. French toast, double bacon.

91
00:03:03,734 --> 00:03:04,714
蛋白配无黄油烤面包片[蠢货]
Egg whites, dry toast.

92
00:03:04,714 --> 00:03:05,684
该死
Damn it.

93
00:03:07,065 --> 00:03:08,005
我跟你说吧 格尔
Let me tell you something, Gil.

94
00:03:08,005 --> 00:03:09,396
你或许是很厉害
You may be top dog,

95
00:03:09,396 --> 00:03:11,146
但是会后悔的人是你
but you're the one who's gonna have regrets,

96
00:03:11,216 --> 00:03:13,837
因为这房子弹指一挥就能卖掉
'cause this house is gonna sell like... that.

97
00:03:20,209 --> 00:03:21,750
今天又是一场空
That's it for today.

98
00:03:22,090 --> 00:03:23,871
我们要老死在这房子里了
We're going to die in this house.

99
00:03:23,881 --> 00:03:25,641
靠枕都不那么蓬松了
Oh, the pillows have lost their fluff.

100
00:03:25,641 --> 00:03:28,172
靠枕不是问题所在
The pillows are not the problem!

101
00:03:32,574 --> 00:03:34,574
没事 曼尼 那一会儿见
It's okay, Manny. I'll see you in a minute.

102
00:03:34,574 --> 00:03:38,016
好 我会很礼貌很友好的 我保证
Yes, I'll be polite and I'll be nice. I promise.

103
00:03:38,356 --> 00:03:39,816
我要杀了他
I'm going to kill him.

104
00:03:39,816 --> 00:03:40,997
哈维尔这次又怎么了
What'd Javier do this time?

105
00:03:41,007 --> 00:03:42,987
他和他儿子好不容易共度周末
His one big weekend alone with his son,

106
00:03:42,987 --> 00:03:44,228
我才知道
and I just found out

107
00:03:44,228 --> 00:03:46,719
他把他新搞上的姘头也带过来了
that he brought his latest bimbo along.

108
00:03:46,719 --> 00:03:48,219
他总是这样
He always does this.

109
00:03:48,219 --> 00:03:50,110
你还记得那次他带曼尼
You remember that time that he took Manny

110
00:03:50,110 --> 00:03:51,250
和那个脱衣舞娘去钓鱼的事吗
and that stripper fishing?

111
00:03:51,250 --> 00:03:52,761
记得 他们连鱼毛都没钓到[乳头]
Yeah. They barely got a nipple.

112
00:03:53,761 --> 00:03:55,582
拜托 那很经典 我刚想到的
Come on. That was good. I just thought of that.

113
00:03:55,582 --> 00:03:56,322
你闹够了没
Are you done?

114
00:03:56,322 --> 00:03:58,193
我猜她一定很满意那根钓鱼"棍"
I bet she was comfortable with the pole.

115
00:03:59,133 --> 00:04:00,473
我应该在说完"乳头"就闭嘴的
Ah. Should've quit after "Nipple."

116
00:04:00,473 --> 00:04:02,224
雷诺怎么每晚说荤段子都不累啊
How does Leno do it night after night?

117
00:04:02,224 --> 00:04:04,395
我也在想我每晚是怎么忍受你的
I was just wondering that about myself.

118
00:04:06,876 --> 00:04:09,096
菲尔 拜托 告诉我们点好消息
Phil, please. Tell us that you have some good news.

119
00:04:09,096 --> 00:04:11,337
情况有点复杂 因为我没有好消息
Well, it's complicated because I don't have good news,

120
00:04:11,337 --> 00:04:13,028
不过我真心希望你们喜欢我
But I really want you guys to like me.

121
00:04:13,028 --> 00:04:13,518
什么
What?

122
00:04:13,518 --> 00:04:15,388
格尔·索普打电话来说有新买家
Gil thorpe called back with another offer,

123
00:04:15,388 --> 00:04:17,449
但是比上一位出的价格低一万美元
But it was $10,000 lower than the last one.

124
00:04:17,449 --> 00:04:18,339
低
Lower?

125
00:04:18,339 --> 00:04:20,230
好极了 那真是好极了 好极了
Oh, that is perfect. That's just perfect.

126
00:04:20,240 --> 00:04:21,941
你有什么想说的吗 米奇尔
Something you wanna say, Mitchell?

127
00:04:22,541 --> 00:04:23,921
是吧 我早告诉过你吧
Yes. I told you so.

128
00:04:23,921 --> 00:04:25,322
我警告过你会出现这种情况
I warned you this would happen.

129
00:04:25,322 --> 00:04:27,333
我试图阻止 但你不听我的
I tried to stop it, but you wouldn't let me.

130
00:04:27,333 --> 00:04:28,853
我对了 你错了
I was right, and you were wrong.

131
00:04:28,853 --> 00:04:32,144
你生活在可笑的被甜言蜜语包围的幻境中
You live in this ridiculous candy-colored fantasy land.

132
00:04:32,154 --> 00:04:33,775
我可比你聪明多了
I am so much smarter than you,

133
00:04:33,775 --> 00:04:36,006
我没落井下石奚落你 真是憋死我了
and it is killing me not to rub your nose in it!

134
00:04:36,006 --> 00:04:37,386
不是 我只是在思考而已
No. I'm just thinking.

135
00:04:37,386 --> 00:04:38,807
好了 伙计们 我们得做点什么
Okay, guys, we have to do something.

136
00:04:38,817 --> 00:04:40,857
我们不能再把这房子留在手上了
We can't carry this house for much longer.

137
00:04:40,917 --> 00:04:42,708
小卡 你前期设计花了多少钱
Cam, what did you spend on staging?

138
00:04:42,878 --> 00:04:44,228
让我想想 我不知道
Uh, let's see. I don't know.

139
00:04:44,228 --> 00:04:45,559
你怎么可以不知道
How can you not know?!

140
00:04:45,559 --> 00:04:48,830
因为我如饥似渴 所有东西又都那么好
Because I was hungry, and everything was so pretty.

141
00:04:48,830 --> 00:04:50,010
我以为这个不算事儿
and I didn't think it would matter

142
00:04:50,020 --> 00:04:50,991
因为谁会想到
because who could've guessed

143
00:04:50,991 --> 00:04:53,041
我们到现在还不能把房子卖出去啊
we wouldn't have sold the house by now?

144
00:04:53,392 --> 00:04:54,312
我
Me.

145
00:04:54,482 --> 00:04:56,033
菲尔 你觉得能不能
Phil, do you think you can

146
00:04:56,043 --> 00:04:57,723
让格尔·索普把价格提高到第一次报的价格
Get Gil Thorpe up to his original offer?

147
00:04:57,723 --> 00:04:58,934
-怎么弄 -我不知道
- How? - I don't know.

148
00:04:58,934 --> 00:05:01,314
你行的 拍他马屁 哄他开心
You could, uh, flatter him, stroke his ego.

149
00:05:01,314 --> 00:05:03,705
不 他不会上当的 他太聪明了
No, he'd never fall for that. He's too smart.

150
00:05:03,995 --> 00:05:06,886
亲爱的 如果说有谁能搞定 那只能是你了
But, honey, if anybody can pull it off, you can.

151
00:05:07,366 --> 00:05:09,267
你做什么都很出色
You're so good at everything.

152
00:05:09,657 --> 00:05:10,618
那倒没错
That is true.

153
00:05:10,618 --> 00:05:11,568
我试试
I'll do it.

154
00:05:14,269 --> 00:05:15,499
我们回来了
We're back!

155
00:05:16,740 --> 00:05:20,601
我真不敢相信 你又带了个妞来
I cannot believe that again you brought a girl.

156
00:05:20,601 --> 00:05:21,701
这次的女人又是干什么的
What is it this time?

157
00:05:21,701 --> 00:05:23,102
调鸡尾酒的服务员吗
A cocktail waitress?

158
00:05:23,102 --> 00:05:25,373
船模 还是脱衣舞娘
A boat show model? A stripper?

159
00:05:25,423 --> 00:05:27,373
不是 那样我可就挣大钱了
No, then I could make real money.

160
00:05:27,373 --> 00:05:28,964
我只是个博士而已
I'm just a PHD.

161
00:05:28,964 --> 00:05:30,364
妈妈 这位是崔茜
Mom, this is Trish.

162
00:05:30,494 --> 00:05:32,395
-歌洛莉亚 你好 -你好
- Gloria, hi. - Hi.

163
00:05:32,395 --> 00:05:33,165
-杰 -你好
- Jay. - How do you do?

164
00:05:33,165 --> 00:05:35,186
我听过很多关于你的事情
I have heard so much about you.

165
00:05:35,186 --> 00:05:36,767
她在艺术博物馆工作
She works at the museum of art.

166
00:05:36,767 --> 00:05:39,167
太酷了 我们在闭馆之后过去参观的
It was so cool. We got an after hours tour,

167
00:05:39,167 --> 00:05:41,768
崔茜说可以开闪光灯给那些画拍照
and Trish said I could take flash pictures of the paintings.

168
00:05:41,768 --> 00:05:42,779
不过别担心 我没照
But don't worry. I didn't.

169
00:05:42,779 --> 00:05:43,389
真是松了一口气啊
That's a relief.

170
00:05:43,389 --> 00:05:44,939
我还担心得被迫欣赏照片呢
I was afraid I was gonna have to look at 'em.

171
00:05:44,939 --> 00:05:46,630
那么你是在博物馆工作啊
So you work at the museum?

172
00:05:46,750 --> 00:05:48,051
不是 我只是董事会成员
Oh, no. I'm just on the board.

173
00:05:48,051 --> 00:05:50,641
我负责佳士得拍卖行的艺术品和古董业务
I run the art and antiquities department at Christie's.

174
00:05:51,392 --> 00:05:53,412
让我想想 我想用个什么词来着
Let me see. What is the word I am looking for?

175
00:05:53,412 --> 00:05:55,123
有了 晴天霹雳
Oh, yes. Bam!

176
00:05:55,883 --> 00:05:57,494
你们两个是怎么认识的
So how did you two meet?

177
00:05:57,494 --> 00:05:59,825
我玩扑克时赢了一台车 可那台车自燃了
I won a car in a poker game, but it caught on fire,

178
00:05:59,835 --> 00:06:01,385
于是那家伙给了我一幅画
so the guy gave me a painting.

179
00:06:01,385 --> 00:06:02,756
我把画拿到拍卖行
I took it to the auction house,

180
00:06:02,756 --> 00:06:04,466
弄来弄去 我赚了一大笔
Eh, ticky ticky, I made a big profit

181
00:06:04,466 --> 00:06:07,247
不过我还是带走了一幅大师级的作品
but I still came home with a masterpiece.

182
00:06:07,597 --> 00:06:08,738
他说的是她
He means her.

183
00:06:09,218 --> 00:06:12,449
我可不可以说 你家儿子实在太棒了
May I tell you, you have a wonderful boy?

184
00:06:12,519 --> 00:06:14,860
彬彬有礼 风度翩翩
So well-mannered and chivalrous.

185
00:06:14,860 --> 00:06:16,540
他就好像是从盖恩丝博勒或者范戴克
It's like he leapt off the canvas

186
00:06:16,540 --> 00:06:19,691
16世纪时的帆布肖像画里跳出来的似的
Of a 16th century portrait by Gainsborough or Van Dyke.

187
00:06:20,342 --> 00:06:22,122
听听人家多有学识
Listen to that brain.

188
00:06:22,122 --> 00:06:23,143
他们能留下来吃饭吗
Can they stay for dinner?

189
00:06:23,153 --> 00:06:24,923
那得他们说了算 小乖乖
Well, that's up to them, papi.

190
00:06:24,923 --> 00:06:26,644
我怎么会拒绝免费的晚餐呢
How can I turn down a free meal?

191
00:06:26,644 --> 00:06:27,834
第一次总是最艰难的
First time's the hardest.

192
00:06:27,834 --> 00:06:29,045
你觉得呢 我亲爱的
What do you say, my love?

193
00:06:29,055 --> 00:06:32,296
我觉得我现在还不想和这个小家伙告别
Well, I'm not sure I'm ready to say good-bye to this guy yet.

194
00:06:32,296 --> 00:06:34,717
不敢要让我留下来 我必须有所贡献
But I'll only stay if you let me contribute.

195
00:06:34,717 --> 00:06:38,488
我还真带了一瓶超棒的82年的波尔多红酒
I did bring along a fabulous bottle of '82 bordeaux

196
00:06:38,488 --> 00:06:39,818
原打算我们周末喝的
that we didn't get to this weekend.

197
00:06:39,818 --> 00:06:41,369
那么好的酒 你想把曼尼带回家都行
For that, you can take Manny home.

198
00:06:41,379 --> 00:06:42,960
瞧我每天得忍受什么样的人了吧
See what I have to put up with?

199
00:06:44,390 --> 00:06:45,290
格尔
Gil!

200
00:06:45,430 --> 00:06:46,481
我是菲尔·邓菲
Phil Dunphy.

201
00:06:47,931 --> 00:06:49,752
我就知道你会吃回头草的
I knew you'd come slinking back!

202
00:06:49,752 --> 00:06:50,592
伙计们
Hey, guys!

203
00:06:50,592 --> 00:06:53,213
是邓菲 他屈服了 我就跟你们说吧
It's Dunphy. He's cavin'. What did I tell you?

204
00:06:53,213 --> 00:06:54,514
跟你们说什么来着
What did I tell you, hey?

205
00:06:55,924 --> 00:06:59,285
邓菲 我可以把你"玩弄"于鼓掌间
Oh, Dunphy, I can play you like a ukulele,

206
00:06:59,285 --> 00:07:01,366
因为你又弱小又可口
'cause you're small and dainty.

207
00:07:01,366 --> 00:07:03,607
格尔 我想跟你谈谈你的出价
Gil, I wanna talk to you about your offer.

208
00:07:03,607 --> 00:07:05,087
我给你打住吧
Let me stop you right there.

209
00:07:05,177 --> 00:07:06,508
接下来应该这样进行
This is how this is gonna go down.

210
00:07:07,168 --> 00:07:09,369
首先 我会带你吃一顿精致的晚餐
First of all, I'm gonna take you out to a very nice dinner.

211
00:07:10,009 --> 00:07:11,850
我会跟你亲密地聊天
I'm gonna talk really sweet to you.

212
00:07:12,060 --> 00:07:14,590
接着 我会在火炉边将你扑倒
And then I'm gonna lay you down by the fire...

213
00:07:14,600 --> 00:07:16,081
刚开始我会很温柔 然后
Oh. Slow at first, then...

214
00:07:16,081 --> 00:07:17,491
如果你们是在讨论卖房子的事
If you guys are talking about the house,

215
00:07:17,491 --> 00:07:18,812
我的朋友扎克还在找卖家
My friend Zack's still looking.

216
00:07:18,812 --> 00:07:21,083
宝贝 14岁的孩子买不起房子的
Honey, 14-year-olds can't afford to buy houses.

217
00:07:21,093 --> 00:07:22,343
他才不是14岁
He's not 14.

218
00:07:22,353 --> 00:07:24,584
他是名程序员 在我们学校做志愿者
He's a software guy who volunteers at my school.

219
00:07:24,584 --> 00:07:25,374
我们会大汗淋漓
We're gonna be sweating...

220
00:07:25,374 --> 00:07:27,315
他是有收入的成年人吗
He's an adult with money?

221
00:07:27,315 --> 00:07:29,055
他开的车比你的豪华
He drives a nicer car than you.

222
00:07:29,055 --> 00:07:30,146
马上给我他的号码
Get me his number right now!

223
00:07:30,146 --> 00:07:30,896
然后你就会回家
And then you're gonna go home

224
00:07:30,896 --> 00:07:32,547
告诉所有人你去看电影了
and tell everybody you went to the movies,

225
00:07:32,737 --> 00:07:34,147
但你我心知肚明
but you and I both know

226
00:07:34,147 --> 00:07:35,718
你被我的"索"命鱼雷"射"中了
that you got thorpedoed.

227
00:07:36,048 --> 00:07:37,799
你猜怎么着 格尔 我只是出于礼貌
Guess what, Gil. This was a courtesy call

228
00:07:37,809 --> 00:07:39,559
告诉你 我有别的买家了
to tell you that I have another buyer.

229
00:07:39,899 --> 00:07:41,090
现在你可以告诉你的买家
So you can tell your buyer that

230
00:07:41,090 --> 00:07:42,670
你让他们错失了一套好房
you cost them a great house

231
00:07:42,670 --> 00:07:45,981
就因为你骄傲"鸡"大 下"手"太狠
because you got cocky and overplayed your hand.

232
00:07:46,061 --> 00:07:50,263
你就"邓"着感受"菲"一般的痛苦吧
Prepare to Phil the agony of Dun-feat.

233
00:07:50,983 --> 00:07:52,654
姓和名都用上了
Both names!

234
00:07:56,855 --> 00:07:58,526
虽然我不是你这样的艺术达人
Now I'm not an art expert like you,

235
00:07:58,526 --> 00:08:00,586
但我还是在一家上好的维加斯赌场的画廊
but I did acquire this piece in a gallery

236
00:08:00,586 --> 00:08:02,717
淘到了这个雕像
in one of the finer Vegas casinos.

237
00:08:02,717 --> 00:08:03,848
你觉得如何
What do you think?

238
00:08:04,528 --> 00:08:06,078
确实说明了一些东西
It does say something.

239
00:08:06,078 --> 00:08:08,149
他以前会说话 在音盒还没坏的时候
He used to, before his little voice box broke.

240
00:08:08,149 --> 00:08:11,230
他说"欢迎主人回家 今天不顺吗"
It said, "Welcome home, master. Rough day?"

241
00:08:12,751 --> 00:08:13,651
又来
Again?

242
00:08:13,661 --> 00:08:15,762
她让我把雕像放到阁楼 你一定难以置信吧
Would you believe she made me keep this in the attic?

243
00:08:15,932 --> 00:08:17,932
歌洛莉亚 崔茜说这是艺术
Gloria, Trish says this is art.

244
00:08:17,932 --> 00:08:19,633
梭罗怎么说来着
What was it Thoreau said?

245
00:08:19,853 --> 00:08:22,174
"重要的不是眼中所见 而是心中所见"
"It's not what you look at that matters. It's what you see."

246
00:08:22,174 --> 00:08:23,084
听到没
Hear that?

247
00:08:23,234 --> 00:08:24,135
你错了
You were wrong.

248
00:08:24,135 --> 00:08:25,655
继续说呀
Keep talking like that,

249
00:08:25,665 --> 00:08:28,806
然后你就会知道 他的音盒怎么坏的
and you will find out how he lost his voice box.

250
00:08:28,956 --> 00:08:31,407
-什么情况 -他名字叫巴克利
- What have we here? - His name's Barkley.

251
00:08:32,137 --> 00:08:33,038
真是可爱呀
That's delightful.

252
00:08:33,038 --> 00:08:35,348
才不可爱呢 可恶心了
It's not delightful. It's disgusting.

253
00:08:35,348 --> 00:08:37,669
想想沃霍尔 想想昆斯
Uh, look at Warhol. Look at Koons.

254
00:08:37,669 --> 00:08:39,510
很多当代艺术中伟大的作品
A lot of great works of contemporary art

255
00:08:39,510 --> 00:08:41,741
最初都被误认为是垃圾
were initially dismissed as garbage.

256
00:08:41,741 --> 00:08:42,981
说得太对了 崔茜
Excellent point, Trish.

257
00:08:42,991 --> 00:08:44,542
这连垃圾都比不上
This is not even garbage.

258
00:08:44,542 --> 00:08:47,333
没人愿意把它带走 太大装不进垃圾桶
They wouldn't take it. It's too big for the can.

259
00:08:47,333 --> 00:08:50,244
我眼中的他外表是一个人 实质上却不算人
Now what I see is a man who is not man.

260
00:08:50,244 --> 00:08:52,584
他是一位失去了尊严的仆人
He is a servant who has lost his dignity.

261
00:08:52,594 --> 00:08:55,265
说的就是当今社会的阶级制度
It is a commentary on the class system in society--

262
00:08:55,265 --> 00:08:58,707
不过把钥匙和太阳镜放他身上倒是很方便
As well as a handy place to put your keys and sunglasses.

263
00:08:58,707 --> 00:08:59,767
不管他是什么
Whatever he is,

264
00:08:59,767 --> 00:09:01,928
你的巴克利都要被扔进阁楼
your Barkley is going back to the attic.

265
00:09:01,928 --> 00:09:03,298
我去看下宝宝
I'm going to see the baby.

266
00:09:04,328 --> 00:09:05,349
巴克利
Barkley.

267
00:09:05,349 --> 00:09:06,189
名字取得好
Very clever.

268
00:09:06,199 --> 00:09:07,520
来吧 我们玩游戏去
Come on, guys. Let's play.

269
00:09:07,680 --> 00:09:08,780
你们要玩什么
What are you going to play?

270
00:09:08,780 --> 00:09:11,331
猜字游戏 我和崔茜对阵老爸和杰
Charades. Me and Trish against dad and Jay.

271
00:09:11,331 --> 00:09:13,672
我不得不提醒你 杰 他俩很厉害
I have to warn you, Jay. These two are very good.

272
00:09:13,672 --> 00:09:15,372
他们简直就像心有灵犀一般
It's like they have their own language.

273
00:09:15,372 --> 00:09:16,813
我也要玩
I want to play, too.

274
00:09:17,153 --> 00:09:18,393
我该加哪一队
Which team should I join?

275
00:09:18,393 --> 00:09:19,314
-曼尼那队 -杰那队
- Go with Manny. - Go with Jay.

276
00:09:19,314 --> 00:09:20,174
-跟他们 -去他们队
- Them. - His team.

277
00:09:21,815 --> 00:09:23,885
好的 太棒了
Okay, then. Great.

278
00:09:24,115 --> 00:09:25,396
那晚上见
Well, we'll see you tonight.

279
00:09:26,086 --> 00:09:27,727
扎克·巴比确实是名成年人
well, Zack Barbie is indeed an adult,

280
00:09:27,737 --> 00:09:29,587
他喜欢这个社区 很有兴趣
He likes the neighborhood, and he's interested.

281
00:09:29,587 --> 00:09:30,608
感谢上帝
Oh, thank god.

282
00:09:30,958 --> 00:09:33,479
不是吧你 是上帝把他介绍给你们的吗
Really? Did god come in here and tell you about him?

283
00:09:33,479 --> 00:09:35,259
我可不记得有这回事
Because I don't remember it that way.

284
00:09:35,259 --> 00:09:36,800
好啦 够啦 大家
Okay, okay, this is it, people.

285
00:09:36,800 --> 00:09:38,470
我们可不能失去这个买家了
We cannot afford to lose this buyer.

286
00:09:38,470 --> 00:09:39,511
我站起来干嘛
Why am I standing?

287
00:09:39,511 --> 00:09:42,142
菲尔 你觉得这地方适合他吗
Phil, do you think this is the right house for him?

288
00:09:42,152 --> 00:09:43,782
很难说 他年轻 单身
It's hard to tell. He's young. He's single.

289
00:09:43,782 --> 00:09:45,403
其余的信息我就不知道了
I don't know anything else about him.

290
00:09:45,563 --> 00:09:47,603
扎克·巴比 生于1986年
Zack Barbie. Born 1986.

291
00:09:47,603 --> 00:09:49,254
去了一所叫"芝麻"的大学
Went to college at a place called "Mit."

292
00:09:49,254 --> 00:09:49,874
MIT[麻省理工大学]
M.I.T.

293
00:09:49,874 --> 00:09:51,275
我知道怎么拼
I know how to spell it.

294
00:09:52,425 --> 00:09:53,365
五个单词
Five words.

295
00:09:53,365 --> 00:09:54,576
是一本书
It's a book.

296
00:09:55,376 --> 00:09:56,767
有位老人
There's an old man...

297
00:09:57,027 --> 00:09:58,527
在船上
On the boat...

298
00:09:58,857 --> 00:10:00,128
他捕了一条大鱼
He caught a big fish.

299
00:10:00,128 --> 00:10:01,838
《老人和鱼》
The old man and the fish!

300
00:10:01,848 --> 00:10:02,559
时间到
Uh, time!

301
00:10:02,559 --> 00:10:03,989
是《老人与海》
"The old man and the sea"!

302
00:10:03,989 --> 00:10:05,230
从没听过
Never heard about it.

303
00:10:05,230 --> 00:10:07,620
海明威关于人对抗自然的经典著作
Hemingway's classic tale of man versus nature.

304
00:10:07,630 --> 00:10:08,741
让一个和上百只猫一起生活的人
Leave it to a guy with a hundred cats

305
00:10:08,741 --> 00:10:10,141
去写个有关鱼的好故事 对吧
to write a good fish story, right?

306
00:10:10,141 --> 00:10:11,422
哈哈 崔茜
Oh, ho, Trish!

307
00:10:12,012 --> 00:10:14,863
这是在干嘛 读书俱乐部还是游戏
What is this, a book club or a fun game?

308
00:10:14,863 --> 00:10:15,773
上
Go.

309
00:10:21,875 --> 00:10:22,806
玩
Play.

310
00:10:22,996 --> 00:10:24,066
五个单词
Five words.

311
00:10:24,066 --> 00:10:26,107
第二个单词 吓 怕
Second word. Scared. Afraid.

312
00:10:26,107 --> 00:10:27,577
-《谁怕弗吉尼亚·沃尔夫》 -对了
- "Who's Afraid of Virginia Woolf?" - Got it!

313
00:10:27,577 --> 00:10:28,568
你太厉害了
You're amazing!

314
00:10:28,648 --> 00:10:30,808
你都可以以此谋生了
Wowie! You could do this for a living.

315
00:10:30,808 --> 00:10:31,819
真的吗 真的有这行吗
Really? There's such a thing?

316
00:10:31,819 --> 00:10:33,319
不 就像也没有
No, just like there's no such thing

317
00:10:33,319 --> 00:10:35,400
职业百老汇狂热粉丝一样
as a professional Broadway enthusiast.

318
00:10:35,400 --> 00:10:36,760
你得找个正经工作
You're gonna have to get a real job.

319
00:10:36,760 --> 00:10:38,081
好了 轮到我了
Okay, it's my turn.

320
00:10:41,902 --> 00:10:43,043
我不知道这是什么
I don't know this.

321
00:10:45,694 --> 00:10:46,714
我也不知道这是什么
I don't know this.

322
00:10:46,714 --> 00:10:48,374
妈 你拿到哪张就要演哪张
Mom, you have to do the one you pick.

323
00:10:48,374 --> 00:10:49,475
不用 曼尼 没关系
Oh, no, Manny. It's fine.

324
00:10:49,475 --> 00:10:50,685
慢慢挑吧 挑个你喜欢的
Just keep picking until you get one you like.

325
00:10:50,685 --> 00:10:53,806
不 我用不着慢慢挑 我就要这张啦
No, no. I don't have to keep picking. I'm gonna do this one.

326
00:10:57,408 --> 00:10:58,128
不 这个我可以
Uh-oh. No, I got this.

327
00:10:58,128 --> 00:10:59,888
是戏剧 书 还是电影
Is it a play, a book, or a movie?

328
00:10:59,888 --> 00:11:01,299
没错 其中之一
Yeah, one of those.

329
00:11:02,299 --> 00:11:03,490
-《迷失》 -《独领风骚》
- "Lost"! - "Clueless"!

330
00:11:03,490 --> 00:11:04,530
《年少轻狂》
"Dazed and Confused"!

331
00:11:04,540 --> 00:11:05,600
真是太弱智了
This is stupid.

332
00:11:05,610 --> 00:11:07,101
没人能猜得中
Nobody can get this.

333
00:11:07,311 --> 00:11:09,112
你或许说的对 我...
You're probably right. I just...

334
00:11:09,722 --> 00:11:12,063
就是啊 这是我写的 这个太难了
Yeah. See? This is one of mine. It's really hard.

335
00:11:12,063 --> 00:11:13,963
真的吗 是什么 你试试
Really? What is it? You do it.

336
00:11:15,644 --> 00:11:16,584
是戏剧
Play.

337
00:11:17,845 --> 00:11:18,765
《理发师陶德》
"Sweeney Todd"!

338
00:11:18,765 --> 00:11:19,935
答对了
Exactly.

339
00:11:19,965 --> 00:11:20,986
真是最佳拍档
What a team.

340
00:11:22,046 --> 00:11:24,667
这游戏蠢到家了
This is a stupid... game!

341
00:11:27,348 --> 00:11:29,289
好 我在Facebook 推特等各大社交网站上
Okay, so after a quick scan of his Facebook, Twitter,

342
00:11:29,289 --> 00:11:30,689
把他人肉了一遍
Tumblr, Pinterest, and Instagram,

343
00:11:30,689 --> 00:11:31,920
得知如下情况
here is what I know.

344
00:11:31,920 --> 00:11:33,290
这年头还有隐私可言吗
Privacy is dead?

345
00:11:34,120 --> 00:11:36,661
他喜欢的有 芝加哥黑鹰队 跆拳道
Likes--Chicago Blackhawks, kickboxing,

346
00:11:36,661 --> 00:11:38,162
《虎胆龙威》系列电影和啤酒
The movie "Die Hard," and beer.

347
00:11:38,162 --> 00:11:40,573
-听起来像入过兄弟会 -他爱好多着呢
- He sounds like a frat boy. - Oh, he's many things.

348
00:11:40,573 --> 00:11:42,383
他喜欢冥想 喜欢印第安菜
He meditates, he loves Indian food,

349
00:11:42,383 --> 00:11:44,374
他超爱他的狗狗奥蒂斯
And he's crazy about his dog Otis.

350
00:11:44,374 --> 00:11:45,504
这房子开了狗洞吗
Does the house have a doggie door?

351
00:11:45,504 --> 00:11:46,264
-没有 -没有
- No. - No.

352
00:11:46,274 --> 00:11:48,215
开一个 想拿下巴比 必先拿下奥蒂斯
Put one in. You get to Barbie through Otis.

353
00:11:48,215 --> 00:11:49,956
她的搜查能力堪比《龙纹身少女》的女主角啊
She's like the girl with the dragon tattoo.

354
00:11:49,956 --> 00:11:50,766
而且头发好看多了
With cuter hair.

355
00:11:50,766 --> 00:11:52,577
-别吵吵 -她还真像啊
- Stop talking! - Oh, she really is.

356
00:11:52,577 --> 00:11:54,537
那哥们喜欢穿黑色紧身衣的妹子
Dude has a thing for chicks in black tights,

357
00:11:54,537 --> 00:11:55,818
他喜欢老式校园放克音乐
he likes old school funk,

358
00:11:55,818 --> 00:11:57,989
而且踢球时踢蹦了门牙
and he chipped his front tooth playing soccer.

359
00:11:58,049 --> 00:11:59,449
哎哟喂 真可爱
Aw! It's actually kind of cute.

360
00:11:59,449 --> 00:12:01,000
天呐 你都爱上他了
Oh, my god. You're falling in love with him.

361
00:12:01,000 --> 00:12:02,820
别闹 这是干正经事呢
Oh, please. It's just a job, nothing more.

362
00:12:02,820 --> 00:12:04,811
好 足够拿下他了 行动吧
Okay, that's enough to go on. Let's move.

363
00:12:04,811 --> 00:12:05,321
我们有两个小时
We've got two hours

364
00:12:05,331 --> 00:12:07,142
来把这房子变成扎克·巴比的梦中豪宅
to turn that place into Zack Barbie's dream house.

365
00:12:07,142 --> 00:12:08,872
-"芭比"的梦中豪宅 -我们没时间了
- Barbie's dream house. - We don't have time!

366
00:12:14,284 --> 00:12:16,215
你刚刚闹的是哪出啊
What the hell was all that about?

367
00:12:16,855 --> 00:12:19,106
你问崔茜去啊 她什么都知道
Why don't you ask Trish? She knows everything.

368
00:12:19,106 --> 00:12:20,706
起码她不是个姘头啊
Well, at least she's not a bimbo.

369
00:12:20,936 --> 00:12:23,037
她和曼尼挺玩得来的
She and Manny seem to hit it off fine.

370
00:12:23,187 --> 00:12:24,468
你怎么了
What's the problem?

371
00:12:24,468 --> 00:12:27,859
才一个周末 那孩子就迷上她了
Just one weekend, and he already idolizes her.

372
00:12:27,899 --> 00:12:30,960
他怎么会不迷呢 她可比我聪明多了
And why wouldn't he? She's so much smarter than me.

373
00:12:30,960 --> 00:12:34,001
她对他喜欢的东西了如指掌
She knows so much more about the things that he loves.

374
00:12:34,001 --> 00:12:36,482
他俩有着外人听不懂的笑话
They have their little inside jokes.

375
00:12:37,152 --> 00:12:38,943
要是她还会做他喜欢的卡布奇诺咖啡
If she learns how to froth his cappuccino,

376
00:12:38,943 --> 00:12:39,963
我就彻底淘汰了
I am history.

377
00:12:39,963 --> 00:12:42,674
你跟曼尼的亲密关系是我前所未见的
You and Manny have the closest relationship I've ever seen.

378
00:12:42,904 --> 00:12:43,784
老天 除了你
Hell, he may never form

379
00:12:43,784 --> 00:12:46,155
他不可能跟别的女人有这种健康的关系
a healthy attachment with another woman after you.

380
00:12:46,165 --> 00:12:47,746
你真会哄我
You're just saying that.

381
00:12:47,746 --> 00:12:49,396
曼尼喜欢她也没什么啊
And it doesn't matter if Manny likes her.

382
00:12:49,396 --> 00:12:50,697
照哈维尔的作风
Knowing Javier's track record,

383
00:12:50,697 --> 00:12:52,617
他肯定也会把她甩了的
He'll dump her like he dumps everybody.

384
00:12:52,617 --> 00:12:55,248
你错了 杰 我不会甩她
You are wrong, Jay. I'm not going to dump her.

385
00:12:55,488 --> 00:12:58,019
其实 这个周末 我向崔茜求婚了
In fact, this weekend, I asked Trish to marry me.

386
00:13:01,020 --> 00:13:02,531
你要和她结婚
You're going to marry her?

387
00:13:02,531 --> 00:13:04,632
我想着时机成熟就告诉你
I was waiting for the right time to tell you.

388
00:13:04,632 --> 00:13:05,222
你"成功"了
Nailed it.

389
00:13:05,232 --> 00:13:07,873
我想找你拿回我祖母的戒指
I wanted to ask you for my abuela's ring back.

390
00:13:07,873 --> 00:13:08,983
我希望崔茜戴着它
I really want Trish to wear it.

391
00:13:08,983 --> 00:13:11,834
她是我见过最好的女人
She is the most amazing woman I've ever known.

392
00:13:11,834 --> 00:13:13,785
你看见我正拿着刀吗
You see that I am holding a knife.

393
00:13:13,785 --> 00:13:14,275
得了吧
Please.

394
00:13:14,275 --> 00:13:16,296
我们的婚姻中你有一半时间都拿着刀
Half our marriage was you with a knife.

395
00:13:16,296 --> 00:13:18,757
崔茜就是我的归宿 曼尼已经喜欢她了
Trish is the one. And Manny already loves her.

396
00:13:18,757 --> 00:13:20,137
他现在可以有更多时间跟我们在一起
He can spend more time with us now--

397
00:13:20,137 --> 00:13:21,668
节假日 甚至暑假都行
Holidays, summers even.

398
00:13:21,668 --> 00:13:23,618
好 我去给你拿戒指
Fine. I'll go get you the ring.

399
00:13:23,618 --> 00:13:25,049
你欠我8美元
But you owe me $8

400
00:13:25,049 --> 00:13:27,269
因为我把你所谓的"绿宝石"换掉了
Because I had to replace "The emerald."

401
00:13:37,673 --> 00:13:39,704
哈维尔 你带过不少30多岁的"美酒"来我家
Javier, you've brought a lot of 30-year-olds around here,

402
00:13:39,704 --> 00:13:41,324
但我最喜欢这回的
but this one's my favorite.

403
00:13:41,334 --> 00:13:42,845
而且我也很喜欢崔茜
And I like Trish, too.

404
00:13:43,235 --> 00:13:43,975
我也是
Me, too.

405
00:13:43,975 --> 00:13:45,246
好 那我估计
Well, then I suppose this is

406
00:13:45,246 --> 00:13:47,977
曼尼 现在是时候告诉你了
as good a moment as any to tell you, Manny.

407
00:13:48,367 --> 00:13:50,087
我和崔茜要结婚了
Trish and I are getting married.

408
00:13:50,087 --> 00:13:52,668
我的天 这真是最好的消息
Oh, my gosh. This is the best news ever!

409
00:13:54,139 --> 00:13:55,489
来 喝一杯
Here. Drink.

410
00:13:55,659 --> 00:13:57,030
亲爱的 听我说
Now listen, my love.

411
00:13:57,930 --> 00:14:00,361
这是我祖母传下来的戒指
This belonged to my abuela.

412
00:14:00,621 --> 00:14:02,182
哈维尔 现在可能不合适
Um, maybe not now, Javier.

413
00:14:02,182 --> 00:14:03,372
不不 请听我说
No, no. Please. Please.

414
00:14:03,372 --> 00:14:05,703
我真心希望 这枚戒指能戴在你的
It will fill my heart to see this ring on your...

415
00:14:06,623 --> 00:14:07,663
纤纤玉手上
Your finger.

416
00:14:08,134 --> 00:14:10,104
小了点儿哈
Oh. It's-- it's a little small.

417
00:14:10,915 --> 00:14:11,635
我戴不了
I can't do this.

418
00:14:11,635 --> 00:14:13,335
没事儿 我用点劲就是了
No, no. I'll just push a little harder.

419
00:14:13,335 --> 00:14:16,116
哈维尔 别弄了 不可能的
Javier, stop. It'll never work.

420
00:14:16,627 --> 00:14:17,847
等一下 宝贝
But wait, my love.

421
00:14:18,047 --> 00:14:19,848
在你的手指上抹点黄油就行了
We can put butter on your finger.

422
00:14:22,739 --> 00:14:23,949
他来了 开音乐
That's him. Hit it.

423
00:14:27,980 --> 00:14:29,371
你好啊 不是他
Hey! Not him.

424
00:14:29,661 --> 00:14:31,342
伙计们 抱歉我去了那么久
Hey, guys. Sorry it took me so long.

425
00:14:31,342 --> 00:14:33,692
我以前从没买过啤酒 种类太多了
I've never bought beer before. There's just so many choices.

426
00:14:33,692 --> 00:14:34,923
我们喝得了那么多吗
Do we really need that much?

427
00:14:34,923 --> 00:14:36,573
不清楚 这些算多吗
I don't know. Is this a lot?

428
00:14:37,844 --> 00:14:39,154
好戏开始了
Showtime!

429
00:14:40,755 --> 00:14:42,225
你好啊 不是他
Hey! Not him.

430
00:14:42,425 --> 00:14:45,477
大家好 我就是来看看情况如何了
Hey! Thought I'd just swing by and see how it's going.

431
00:14:45,477 --> 00:14:46,607
扎克在吗
Zack here?

432
00:14:46,637 --> 00:14:47,657
我的天
Oh, my God.

433
00:14:47,897 --> 00:14:49,858
你穿了黑色紧身衣
You are wearing black tights.

434
00:14:49,858 --> 00:14:51,709
艾丽克斯说得对 你就是喜欢他
Alex was right. You are into him.

435
00:14:51,709 --> 00:14:52,949
那个荡妇佐伊伤透了他的心
That skank Zoey broke his heart.

436
00:14:52,949 --> 00:14:53,929
我可以抚平他的伤痛
I can make him whole again!

437
00:14:53,929 --> 00:14:54,980
海莉
Haley.

438
00:14:55,920 --> 00:14:57,191
好了 这回该是他了
Okay, that has to be him.

439
00:14:57,191 --> 00:14:58,541
我们自己家的人都已经在这儿了
Everyone we know is already here.

440
00:14:58,551 --> 00:15:01,472
-大家站好位 不要出差错 -好
- Everyone, places. Let's make this perfect. - Yes.

441
00:15:01,922 --> 00:15:02,843
我是艾拉·格拉斯
I'm Ira Glass.

442
00:15:02,843 --> 00:15:03,833
-今天的节目 -不不
- Today on the program... - No, no.

443
00:15:03,833 --> 00:15:04,873
-不是这个 -关掉
- That's not it.- Turn that off!

444
00:15:04,873 --> 00:15:06,464
-不不不 -快关掉
- No, no, no, no, no! - Turn it off!

445
00:15:06,804 --> 00:15:07,744
那是后退键
It's the back button.

446
00:15:08,424 --> 00:15:10,235
你好啊 你一定是扎克吧
Hey! You must be Zack.

447
00:15:10,235 --> 00:15:11,716
我是菲尔·邓菲 快请进
I'm Phil Dunphy. Come on in.

448
00:15:11,716 --> 00:15:12,996
你好
Hi.

449
00:15:13,036 --> 00:15:14,176
他们是我的同事
These are my associates.

450
00:15:14,176 --> 00:15:15,567
-你好 晚上好 -你好
- Hello! Good evening. - Hi!

451
00:15:15,567 --> 00:15:16,567
你好呀
Hi!

452
00:15:16,567 --> 00:15:18,508
那位 是我女儿
Oh, and my, uh, my daughter.

453
00:15:18,788 --> 00:15:21,429
就是这里啦
So... This is the place.

454
00:15:21,489 --> 00:15:22,389
看起来不错
Looks nice.

455
00:15:22,389 --> 00:15:23,800
扎克 你饿了没
So, Zack, you hungry?

456
00:15:23,800 --> 00:15:26,101
没有 但是闻起来好香啊
Uh, no. But, uh, it smells great.

457
00:15:26,101 --> 00:15:29,252
是从离这里不远的一个很棒的印度餐厅买的
Yeah, it's from this amazing Indian place just down the road.

458
00:15:29,252 --> 00:15:30,522
走路就到了
It's walking distance.

459
00:15:30,522 --> 00:15:31,402
那可真好
Which is awesome

460
00:15:31,402 --> 00:15:33,883
就算你喝多了也没事 对吧
if you've had one too many brewskis, am I right?

461
00:15:33,913 --> 00:15:34,924
是啊
Yeah.

462
00:15:36,574 --> 00:15:39,775
有谁是黑鹰队的粉丝吗 我超爱黑鹰队
Oh. Is someone a blackhawks fan? Love the hawks.

463
00:15:39,885 --> 00:15:42,156
是啊 那可真够巧的
Yeah, well, that's a weird coincidence.

464
00:15:42,476 --> 00:15:43,967
我们去看看跆拳道健身房吧
Let's go check out the kickboxing gym.

465
00:15:43,967 --> 00:15:45,747
真的吗 我正好练跆拳道
Seriously? I kickbox.

466
00:15:45,747 --> 00:15:46,698
-不是吧 -真的
- What?! - Yeah.

467
00:15:46,698 --> 00:15:47,688
走吧
Come on!

468
00:15:49,999 --> 00:15:50,939
海莉
Haley!

469
00:15:53,130 --> 00:15:54,690
崔茜 开门
Trish, open up!

470
00:15:54,690 --> 00:15:56,491
不 我现在不想看见你
No. I don't want to see you right now.

471
00:15:56,491 --> 00:15:58,512
开门 不然我踹门进来了
Open up, or I'm going to break down the door!

472
00:15:58,512 --> 00:16:01,093
别冲动 那门可跟你无冤无仇
Hey! Hey, hey, hey! Don't break down the door!

473
00:16:01,123 --> 00:16:01,743
见鬼
Ay, caramba.

474
00:16:01,743 --> 00:16:03,594
我真该直接买个新戒指
I'm beginning to think I should've just bought a ring.

475
00:16:03,594 --> 00:16:05,124
-让我和她谈谈 -你
- Let me talk to her. - You?

476
00:16:05,634 --> 00:16:08,165
对 她吓到了 也许我能出点力
Yes. She's scared. Maybe I can help.

477
00:16:08,165 --> 00:16:10,396
送她走远点 拜拜哟
Help her go... Adios.

478
00:16:10,596 --> 00:16:11,406
去吧
Go ahead.

479
00:16:11,406 --> 00:16:13,557
你告诉她 她现在头脑不清楚 很不理智
And you tell her she's being crazy and irrational.

480
00:16:13,557 --> 00:16:16,118
如果她不出来 我就把这房子烧了
And if she doesn't come out, I'm going to burn down this house!

481
00:16:16,118 --> 00:16:18,009
别烧我们家房子
Don't burn down the house!

482
00:16:18,699 --> 00:16:21,050
崔茜 开开门 我是歌洛莉亚
Trish, open! It's Gloria.

483
00:16:23,000 --> 00:16:25,371
抱歉 我想一个人静静
I'm sorry. I needed to be alone.

484
00:16:25,401 --> 00:16:26,872
在曼尼的卧室里吗
In Manny's bedroom?

485
00:16:27,132 --> 00:16:29,693
我之前以为这里是个卫生间
Well... I thought it was a bathroom.

486
00:16:29,693 --> 00:16:31,323
有一股混合香料的味道
It smells like potpourri.

487
00:16:31,903 --> 00:16:32,654
听我说
Listen,

488
00:16:32,654 --> 00:16:35,114
我是最了解你现在这种
I would be the first person to understand that

489
00:16:35,114 --> 00:16:37,915
犹豫要不要嫁给哈维尔的心情了
you're having second thoughts about marrying Javier.

490
00:16:38,206 --> 00:16:39,176
确实
I am,

491
00:16:39,326 --> 00:16:40,996
但我真的很爱他
but I do love him.

492
00:16:41,006 --> 00:16:42,167
我知道你爱他
Of course you do,

493
00:16:42,167 --> 00:16:45,768
尽管他这个人没有责任心 冲动任性
even though he's irresponsible and impulsive,

494
00:16:45,778 --> 00:16:47,599
而且如果你的姐妹们有那么一丁点姿色
and if your sisters are even a little bit pretty,

495
00:16:47,599 --> 00:16:49,710
-他都会 -不不不 不是这些
- he's gonna try-- - No, no, no, no, no. It's not that.

496
00:16:49,780 --> 00:16:51,150
是因为他酗酒吗
Is it the drinking?

497
00:16:52,100 --> 00:16:53,431
还是因为他好赌
Is it the gambling?

498
00:16:54,081 --> 00:16:55,762
难道因为你手指粗吗
Is it because of your fat fingers?

499
00:16:55,762 --> 00:16:57,502
-不 是因为你 -我
- No, it's you. - Me?

500
00:16:57,502 --> 00:16:59,113
我怎么比得上你
How can I compete with you?

501
00:16:59,113 --> 00:17:00,413
曼尼三句话不离
All Manny talks about

502
00:17:00,413 --> 00:17:02,744
他有世界上最好的妈妈
is how he's got the world's greatest mom.

503
00:17:02,744 --> 00:17:04,835
而且我知道哈维尔有多后悔失去你
And I know how Javier regrets losing you.

504
00:17:04,835 --> 00:17:05,965
他才没有
No, he doesn't.

505
00:17:05,965 --> 00:17:07,826
相信我 他有的
Oh, believe me, he does.

506
00:17:07,996 --> 00:17:10,557
而我又怎么能怪他呢 你是这么的
And who could blame him? I mean...

507
00:17:10,997 --> 00:17:12,237
瞧瞧你
Look at you!

508
00:17:12,287 --> 00:17:14,378
谁能有这种傲人身姿
Who has a body like that?!

509
00:17:14,598 --> 00:17:17,059
而且你两个月前才生了个宝宝
And you just had a baby two months ago?

510
00:17:17,059 --> 00:17:19,560
你莫非是住在健身房吗
I mean, what--do you just live at the gym?

511
00:17:19,560 --> 00:17:21,611
人家哪有空去健身房
Who has time for the gym?

512
00:17:23,151 --> 00:17:24,652
你知道我午餐吃了什么吗
You know what I had for lunch?!

513
00:17:24,652 --> 00:17:26,232
我只吃了半个燕麦棒
I had a half a granola bar,

514
00:17:26,232 --> 00:17:29,123
但我还是扣不上裤子上的扣子
and I can't button my pants!

515
00:17:29,123 --> 00:17:30,864
我不会做饭
I can't cook!

516
00:17:31,064 --> 00:17:34,415
而且我的床上功夫撑死了算中等
And at best, I am average in bed!

517
00:17:34,535 --> 00:17:35,595
我永远
And I will never,

518
00:17:35,595 --> 00:17:40,417
永远不能达到歌洛莉亚女神的高度
ever, ever live up to the great Gloria!

519
00:17:41,748 --> 00:17:43,828
欢迎成为我们家的一员
Welcome to the family!

520
00:17:47,279 --> 00:17:49,530
话说你从花园后面
And did I mention that from the back of the garden,

521
00:17:49,530 --> 00:17:51,421
可以看到拍摄《虎胆龙威》的
you can almost see a piece of the building

522
00:17:51,421 --> 00:17:53,161
那栋楼的一角
that they shot "Die hard" in?

523
00:17:54,212 --> 00:17:55,592
我有时候挺喜欢坐在那儿的
I like to sit back there sometimes.

524
00:17:55,592 --> 00:17:58,503
那是一个整理思绪的好地方 还可以
It's a great place to gather my thoughts and just...

525
00:17:58,663 --> 00:17:59,874
怎么说呢 静静沉思
I don't know. Be in the now.

526
00:17:59,874 --> 00:18:01,244
我每天都会冥想
I meditate every day.

527
00:18:01,304 --> 00:18:02,615
我的老天爷啊
Yippee-ki-yay!

528
00:18:02,615 --> 00:18:04,225
怎么这么巧呢
What are the odds?

529
00:18:04,906 --> 00:18:06,476
我这样说也许
You know, this is probably not gonna help

530
00:18:06,476 --> 00:18:08,177
不利于还价 但是
my negotiating power, but...

531
00:18:08,447 --> 00:18:10,557
我有点无法相信这房子的完美程度
I kinda can't believe how perfect this house is.

532
00:18:10,908 --> 00:18:14,999
想想看 小奥蒂斯会多喜欢这道狗门啊
And how much is little Otis gonna enjoy this doggie door?

533
00:18:16,129 --> 00:18:18,280
你怎么会知道我的小狗叫什么
How do you... know my dog's name?

534
00:18:18,520 --> 00:18:19,130
我不知道
I don't.

535
00:18:19,130 --> 00:18:21,171
你知道 你刚刚说了奥蒂斯
Yeah, you do. You just said "Otis."

536
00:18:21,181 --> 00:18:22,832
不不 他说的是
No. No, no, he said,

537
00:18:22,842 --> 00:18:26,043
噢 这道狗门会非常适合你的狗狗
"Oh, dis doggie door would be perfect for your dog..."

538
00:18:26,933 --> 00:18:28,284
你应该有养狗吧
Should you own one.

539
00:18:28,524 --> 00:18:30,684
-跟他说的完全不沾边 -我听到是这样
- That's not even close to what he just said. - That's what I heard.

540
00:18:30,694 --> 00:18:32,165
总之 办第三方托管非常快
Anyway, we can do a very fast escrow

541
00:18:32,165 --> 00:18:34,226
你到月底就能拿到这房子
and get you in this house by the end of the month.

542
00:18:34,226 --> 00:18:36,887
正好可以赶上你的生日
Oh! Just in time for your birthday!

543
00:18:37,077 --> 00:18:38,147
太诡异了
This is weird!

544
00:18:38,217 --> 00:18:39,127
令我毛骨悚然
It's totally weird.

545
00:18:39,127 --> 00:18:41,628
黑鹰队 你知道我的生日
Okay, the blackhawks, you know my birthday,

546
00:18:41,838 --> 00:18:43,309
你知道我的狗叫什么
and you know my dog's name.

547
00:18:43,309 --> 00:18:45,530
-我快被你们吓死了 -等等
- You guys are freaking me out. - Okay, wait a second.

548
00:18:45,530 --> 00:18:47,400
我们对这间房子倾注了心血
We poured our hearts into this house,

549
00:18:47,400 --> 00:18:49,771
我们只是想让你知道
and we just wanted to show you what it would be like

550
00:18:49,771 --> 00:18:51,552
住这房子会是什么感觉
if you were living here.

551
00:18:51,552 --> 00:18:53,882
我们稍稍过分了点吗
Did we go a tiny bit overboard?

552
00:18:57,174 --> 00:18:58,124
我的天
Oh, my god.

553
00:18:59,374 --> 00:19:00,365
我最喜欢的歌
Favorite song.

554
00:19:00,525 --> 00:19:01,795
-做的"好" -慢走不送
- Way to go. - You take care.

555
00:19:03,026 --> 00:19:05,026
这里到底能不能看到《虎胆龙威》的拍摄大厦
Can you even see the "Die hard" building from here?

556
00:19:05,026 --> 00:19:06,017
不行
No.

557
00:19:07,567 --> 00:19:09,268
我也会去科切拉音乐节 我会去找你的
I'll be at coachella, too! I'll come find you!

558
00:19:09,268 --> 00:19:10,758
-宝贝 -海莉
- Honey! - Haley!

559
00:19:12,259 --> 00:19:13,539
就这样了
Well, that's it.

560
00:19:14,099 --> 00:19:15,580
我们正式完蛋了
We're officially screwed.

561
00:19:15,620 --> 00:19:16,390
见鬼
Darn it.

562
00:19:16,390 --> 00:19:17,501
没事的 亲爱的
It's okay, honey.

563
00:19:17,501 --> 00:19:20,352
怎么没事 我有责任
No, it's not okay. I feel responsible.

564
00:19:20,592 --> 00:19:22,762
我把大家拖下水的
I dragged us all into this.

565
00:19:22,963 --> 00:19:26,904
这样做的目的就在于 我可以赚点小钱
The whole point was so that I could make a little extra money

566
00:19:26,904 --> 00:19:28,234
对家里做点贡献
and contribute to the family,

567
00:19:28,234 --> 00:19:30,895
结果呢 我却害我们赔钱
and instead, I'm gonna end up costing us.

568
00:19:31,536 --> 00:19:32,436
我太失败了
I'm a failure.

569
00:19:32,436 --> 00:19:34,016
别这样
Hey. Hey.

570
00:19:34,647 --> 00:19:36,447
这种结果谁能预料到呢
No one could've predicted this.

571
00:19:37,568 --> 00:19:38,438
我的错
My bad.

572
00:19:38,438 --> 00:19:39,398
我们再找买家
We'll find another buyer.

573
00:19:39,398 --> 00:19:42,219
-这次我们会吸取教训 -让我来
- This time, we'll learn from our mistakes. - Got it. I got it.

574
00:19:42,689 --> 00:19:43,760
他回来了
He's back!

575
00:19:44,360 --> 00:19:46,991
不不 别这样 别这样
No. No, no, no! Stop! Stop. Stop.

576
00:19:47,081 --> 00:19:49,552
这是间不错的房子 是用正直打造的
This is a great house. It was built with integrity.

577
00:19:49,572 --> 00:19:52,073
出售也要这样 不准再玩花样
We should sell it that way, okay? No more tricks.

578
00:19:52,073 --> 00:19:53,713
-好 -我们要诚实
- Yeah. - Let's just be honest.

579
00:19:53,713 --> 00:19:54,654
不玩花样
No tricks.

580
00:19:56,154 --> 00:19:57,705
-邓菲 -格尔
- Hey, Dunphy. - Gil.

581
00:19:58,435 --> 00:19:59,615
你公司的人说你在这里
Your office said you'd be over here.

582
00:19:59,615 --> 00:20:00,726
对 我在这里
Yeah, I am here.

583
00:20:00,876 --> 00:20:02,056
买家也在这里
With my buyers.

584
00:20:03,517 --> 00:20:04,247
你们觉得怎么样
What do you guys think?

585
00:20:04,247 --> 00:20:06,238
我的天 这房子太完美了
Oh, my god! This house is perfect.

586
00:20:06,238 --> 00:20:09,709
我尤其喜欢客厅温馨的氛围
I especially love the warm embrace of the parlor!

587
00:20:09,709 --> 00:20:11,909
-乐爆你的小心肝吧 -乐爆你的 宝贝
- It screams you. - No, it screams you, sweetie.

588
00:20:11,909 --> 00:20:13,830
还是狗狗门 小卡 看啊
Oh, dis doggie door, Cam. Look. Ooh!

589
00:20:13,830 --> 00:20:15,931
见鬼 同志伴侣
Damn it. Gays.

590
00:20:16,591 --> 00:20:17,741
有他们准没好事
They come to play.

591
00:20:18,342 --> 00:20:19,552
我没空 格尔
I'm busy, Gil.

592
00:20:19,572 --> 00:20:22,563
在问我之前 别接受任何报价
Don't accept any offers without talking to me first.

593
00:20:22,563 --> 00:20:24,144
我的客户想买 明白吗
My buyer wants in, all right?

594
00:20:24,144 --> 00:20:26,374
不好说 买卖几乎敲定了
I don't know. We're pretty far down that road.

595
00:20:26,374 --> 00:20:28,295
好吧 我们会提高价格
All right. We'll up the offer.

596
00:20:28,295 --> 00:20:29,235
格尔
Gil...

597
00:20:30,006 --> 00:20:31,836
我来告诉你事情会怎样
Let me tell you how this is gonna go down.

598
00:20:32,687 --> 00:20:35,488
首先 你要请我共享温馨甜蜜的晚餐
First, you're gonna buy me a lovely dinner.

599
00:20:35,508 --> 00:20:36,658
不 不对
No, that's not it.

600
00:20:36,728 --> 00:20:39,569
首先 我要请你吃一顿温馨甜蜜的晚餐
First, I'm gonna buy you a lovely dinner.

601
00:20:39,919 --> 00:20:41,830
然后我会带你去...
Then I'm gonna take you in the back...

602
00:20:41,830 --> 00:20:43,831
成真了 成真了
It's gonna happen! It's gonna happen!

603
00:20:43,921 --> 00:20:45,401
房子可以卖出去了
We're gonna sell the house.

604
00:20:46,261 --> 00:20:48,962
你瞧 米奇尔 我早告诉你了吧
You see, Mitchell? I told you so.

605
00:20:57,565 --> 00:20:58,956
我老婆 我要接电话
That's my wife. I better take it.

606
00:20:58,956 --> 00:21:00,836
喂 听着 无论你说什么
Hey, hey. Whoa, listen. Whatever you do,

607
00:21:00,836 --> 00:21:02,687
别跟她说你在工作日打高尔夫
don't tell her you're playing golf on a weekday.

608
00:21:02,687 --> 00:21:04,228
否则今晚你就等着洗碗吧
You'll be doing dishes all night.

609
00:21:04,228 --> 00:21:06,228
说的好 多谢了 我的男人
Good call. Thank you, my man.

610
00:21:06,628 --> 00:21:07,879
亲爱的 什么事
Hey, honey. What's up?

611
00:21:08,799 --> 00:21:10,390
不太忙
Oh, not much.

612
00:21:10,390 --> 00:21:11,910
在开会
Just, uh, in a meeting.

613
00:21:12,831 --> 00:21:14,651
努力工作 养家糊口
You know, working hard, bringing home the bacon.

614
00:21:15,431 --> 00:21:16,842
他没有 他在打高尔夫
No, he's not! He's playing golf!

615
00:21:16,842 --> 00:21:17,752
没有
No.

616
00:21:17,922 --> 00:21:19,853
让开 一杆进洞
Um... Fore! Nice putt!

617
00:21:20,503 --> 00:21:22,404
你为什么要骗你老婆 邓菲
Why you lying to your wife, Dunphy?

618
00:21:23,114 --> 00:21:24,725
他中午还喝了啤酒
Hey, he had a beer at lunch, too!

619
00:21:24,735 --> 00:21:25,945
你什么毛病啊
What is wrong with you?

620
00:21:26,525 --> 00:21:27,976
你被我的"索"命鱼雷射中了吧
You just got thorpedoed!

621
00:21:27,976 --> 00:21:29,066
回来
Come back here.
